member.summary:
Gets the Unified devices in the running TIA Portal application.



Example:


http://localhost:7979/unifiedDevices?processId=22604

Answer:


{
    "unifiedDevices": [
        {
            "ProcessId": 22604,
            "Name": "HMI_RT_1",
            "DisplayName": "PC-System_1",
            "GlobalModuleList": [
                "Global module",
                "Global module_1"
            ],
            "ClientResponse": null
        },
        {
            "ProcessId": 22604,
            "Name": "HMI_RT_2",
            "DisplayName": "PC-System_2",
            "GlobalModuleList": [
                "Global module"
            ],
            "ClientResponse": null
        }
    ]
}

Exports the script modules by device from the running TIA Portal application.



Example:


http://localhost:7979/export/unifiedDevices?processId=22604

Request body:


{
    "RootPath":"E:\\TIA",
    "Entities":[
        {
            "DisplayName":"PC-System_1",
            "DeviceName":"HMI_RT_1",
            "GlobalModuleList":["Global module","Global module_1"]
        }
    ]
}

Answer:


{
    "unifiedDevices": [
        {
            "ProcessId": 22604,
            "Name": "HMI_RT_1",
            "DisplayName": "PC-System_1",
            "GlobalModuleList": [
                "Global module",
                "Global module_1"
            ],
            "ClientResponse": null
        },
        {
            "ProcessId": 22604,
            "Name": "HMI_RT_2",
            "DisplayName": "PC-System_2",
            "GlobalModuleList": [
                "Global module"
            ],
            "ClientResponse": null
        }
    ]
}

Imports the script modules by device from the running TIA Portal application.



Example:


http://localhost:7979/import/unifiedDevices?processId=22604

Request body:


{
    "RootPath":"E:\\TIA",
    "Entities":[
        {
            "DisplayName":"PC-System_1",
            "DeviceName":"HMI_RT_1",
            "GlobalModuleList":["Global module","Global module_1"]
        }
    ]
}

Answer:


[
    {
        "Message": "Script module 'Global module' successfully imported into device 'PC-System_1/HMI_RT_1'.",
        "Status": "Success"
    },
    {
        "Message": "Script module 'Global module_1' successfully imported into device 'PC-System_1/HMI_RT_1'.",
        "Status": "Success"
    }
]

