Exports one ore more project library types from the running TIA Portal application.



Example:


http://localhost:7979/export/libraryTypes?processId=22604

Request body:


{
    "RootPath":"E:\\WS\\TIA",
    "Types":[
        "Script module type_1",
        "Script module type_2",
        "Script module type_3"
    ]
}

Answer:


[
    {
        "Message": "Project library type 'Script module type_1' exported successfully to 'E:\\WS\\TIA\\Types\\Script module type_1'",
        "Status": "Success"
    },
    {
        "Message": "Project library type 'Script module type_2' exported successfully to 'E:\\WS\\TIA\\Types\\Script module type_2'",
        "Status": "Success"
    },
    {
        "Message": "Project library type 'Script module type_3' exported successfully to 'E:\\WS\\TIA\\Types\\Script module type_3'",
        "Status": "Success"
    }
]

Imports a project library type into the running TIA Portal application.



Example:


http://localhost:7979/import/libraryTypes?processId=22604

Request body:


{
    "RootPath":"E:\\WS\\TIA",
    "Types":[
        "Script module type_1",
        "Script module type_2",
        "Script module type_3"
    ]
}

Answer:


[
    {
        "Message": "Project library type 'Script module type_1' successfully imported.",
        "Status": "Success"
    },
    {
        "Message": "Project library type 'Script module type_2' successfully imported.",
        "Status": "Success"
    },
    {
        "Message": "Project library type 'Script module type_3' successfully imported.",
        "Status": "Success"
    }
]
